@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
-`linkFormat` defaults to `desktop`, which returns a `superego://...` link. Use
-`web` to return a clickable `https://open.superego.dev/...` redirect link for
-chat surfaces that block custom URL schemes.
+`linkFormat` defaults to `web`, which returns a clickable
+`https://open.superego.dev/#deepLink=...` opener link for chat surfaces that
+block custom URL schemes.
 
-Web links send Superego resource IDs in the URL path to the redirect service.
-Resource IDs can be sensitive. Superego does not store, analyze, or log them in
-the Worker.
+Web links keep Superego resource IDs in the URL fragment. Browsers do not send
+URL fragments to `open.superego.dev`, so sensitive URL data never reaches the
+server and is handled only in the browser.
diff --git a/packages/apps/cli/src/commands/get-deep-link/get-deep-link.test.ts b/packages/apps/cli/src/commands/get-deep-link/get-deep-link.test.ts
new file mode 100644
